{
  "_notes": [
    "Operator/director-editable knobs for the think tank. Edit this file, then",
    "POST /api/policy/reload (player or admin session) -- or wait for the next",
    "import -- for sim.py / serve.py scalar constants to rebind. Every field is",
    "validated against world/config.py:_OPERATOR_SCHEMA; a wrong-typed or",
    "out-of-range value keeps the shipped default for that field (fail-closed",
    "per key). Spend ceilings stay in .env / POST /api/budget -- one source of",
    "truth. Env SIM_WATCHDOG_INTERVAL_S / SIM_WATCHDOG_STALE_S override the two",
    "watchdog fields here when set.",
    "Teams may override a subset of these keys with their own teamwork",
    "agreement (config.TEAM_AGREEABLE_KEYS, written through PUT",
    "/api/teams/{id}); for config.TEAM_CEILING_KEYS the value here is a hard",
    "ceiling -- effective = min(team, operator). Everything else here is",
    "operator-only."
